---
title: "图 06：Workspace 完整业务生命周期"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Provisioning: 客户确认购买
    state "开通中" as Provisioning
    state "运行中" as Running
    state "等待续费" as RenewalDue
    state "到期拒绝访问" as AccessDenied
    state "永久删除中" as Deleting
    state "已删除" as Deleted
    state "人工复核" as ManualReview

    Provisioning --> Running: Launch succeeded
    Provisioning --> ManualReview: 外部结果未知
    Running --> RenewalDue: 接近 paidThrough
    RenewalDue --> Running: 续费成功并延长权益
    RenewalDue --> AccessDenied: 到期且未成功续费
    RenewalDue --> ManualReview: 扣款或资源续期结果未知
    Running --> Deleting: 客户永久删除
    AccessDenied --> Deleting: 客户永久删除
    Deleting --> Deleted: Owner 逐项证明 absence 并写 Receipt
    Deleting --> ManualReview: 任一 Owner 无法证明结果
    ManualReview --> Running: Operator 授权原 Operation 收敛
    ManualReview --> Deleting: 确认进入永久删除
    Deleted --> [*]
